        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam defaultTextAlignment center\n\n&#39; Mendefinisikan aktor di posisi terpisah agar tidak menumpuk di satu sisi\nactor \&quot;Ketua RT / Admin\&quot; as Admin\nactor \&quot;Bendahara\&quot; as Bendahara\nactor \&quot;Warga\&quot; as Warga\n\nrectangle \&quot;VISIBLE (Sistem Informasi Kas RT - 7 Menu Utama)\&quot; {\n  usecase \&quot;1. Login dengan Token Khusus\\n(Admin:4 | Bendahara:5 | Warga:6 digit)\&quot; as UC1\n  \n  &#39; Menu 2: Dashboard\n  usecase \&quot;2a. Lihat Dashboard Utama\\n(Saldo, Grafik, Berita)\&quot; as UC2\n  usecase \&quot;2b. Lihat Daftar Warga Penunggak\\n(Privasi Pengurus)\&quot; as UC2_1\n  usecase \&quot;2c. Lihat Status Tagihan Pribadi\&quot; as UC2_2\n\n  &#39; Menu 3: Data Warga\n  usecase \&quot;3. Kelola Data Warga\\n(CRUD &amp; Status Aktif/Pindah)\&quot; as UC3\n\n  &#39; Menu 4: Iuran &amp; Pembayaran QRIS\n  usecase \&quot;4a. Input &amp; Filter Iuran Manual\&quot; as UC4\n  usecase \&quot;4b. Akses Menu Pembayaran Warga\&quot; as UC14\n  usecase \&quot;Cek Nominal &amp; Tunggakan\&quot; as UC15\n  usecase \&quot;Generate Kode QRIS Otomatis\&quot; as UC16\n  usecase \&quot;Konfirmasi Pembayaran Sukses\\n(Callback Gateway)\&quot; as UC17\n\n  &#39; Menu 5: Pengeluaran &amp; OCR\n  usecase \&quot;5a. Catat Pengeluaran &amp; Kategori\&quot; as UC5\n  usecase \&quot;5b. Scan Foto Nota via OCR\&quot; as UC6\n  usecase \&quot;Validasi Kesesuaian Nominal Nota\&quot; as UC6_1\n\n  &#39; Menu 6: Laporan &amp; Riwayat\n  usecase \&quot;6a. Lihat Rekap Laporan Keuangan\\n(Bulanan &amp; Tahunan)\&quot; as UC7\n  usecase \&quot;6b. Cari &amp; Lihat Detail\\nRiwayat Transaksi Kronologis\&quot; as UC8\n\n  &#39; Menu 7: Pengaturan, Backup, &amp; Broadcast\n  usecase \&quot;7a. Kelola Akun &amp; Hak Akses (RBAC)\&quot; as UC9\n  usecase \&quot;7b. Atur Nominal Default Iuran\&quot; as UC10\n  usecase \&quot;7c. Backup &amp; Restore Data\&quot; as UC11\n  usecase \&quot;7d. Buat &amp; Broadcast Pengumuman\&quot; as UC12\n  usecase \&quot;Terima Notifikasi / Pengumuman\&quot; as UC13\n\n  &#39; --- RELASI WARGA ---\n  Warga --&gt; UC1\n  Warga --&gt; UC2\n  Warga --&gt; UC2_2\n  Warga --&gt; UC14\n  Warga --&gt; UC7\n  Warga --&gt; UC8\n  Warga --&gt; UC13\n  \n  &#39; Include Pembayaran QRIS\n  UC14 ..&gt; UC15 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n  UC14 ..&gt; UC16 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n  UC17 ..&gt; UC14 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n  &#39; --- RELASI BENDAHARA ---\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC1\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC2\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC2_1\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC3\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC4\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC5\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC7\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC8\n  Bendahara --&gt; UC12\n\n  &#39; Include OCR &amp; Validasi Nota\n  UC5 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n  UC6 ..&gt; UC6_1 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n  &#39; --- RELASI KETUA RT / ADMIN ---\n  Admin --&gt; UC1\n  Admin --&gt; UC2\n  Admin --&gt; UC2_1\n  Admin --&gt; UC3\n  Admin --&gt; UC4\n  Admin --&gt; UC5\n  Admin --&gt; UC7\n  Admin --&gt; UC8\n  Admin --&gt; UC9\n  Admin --&gt; UC10\n  Admin --&gt; UC11\n  Admin --&gt; UC12\n}\n\n&#39; Pengaturan layout tambahan agar garis tidak tumpang tindih\nAdmin -[hidden]-&gt; Bendahara\nBendahara -[hidden]-&gt; Warga\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="v2HAi8qRdS5iMcTEbDX0-1">
